direction: right
lock: Original lock and commit / tree / parent identities
objects: Exact regular Git source objects
index: Current index / HEAD / working file proof
static: Selected-file patch audit
result: Immutable source proof; checkoutChecked false
strict: require_committed retains all checkout gates
retired: Retired rule fixtures; never current input
claim: Documentary causal-source borrow
infer: Existing ASCENT eligibility and final source recheck
runtime: Actual runtime and campaign recheck
remote: Full CI and matched macOS still required
lock -> objects
lock -> index
objects -> static: five selected files; no full archive
static -> result
index -> strict: unchanged refusal gates
objects -> retired: original view SHA / status unchanged
objects -> claim: exact original payload
claim -> infer: source citations only
runtime -> infer: no artifact substitution
infer -> remote: eligibility does not grant execution
